OL,3,GNEWSAHoneymoon couple spend night on
OL,4,Aairport floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple who have waited a year to
OL,7,Fhoneymoon in the Maldives are among
OL,8,Ftens of thousands of passengers
OL,9,Fstranded at UK airports.
OL,11,FSam Stansfield said she and husband Dan
OL,12,Fshould have left at 21:45 BST on
OL,13,FTuesday, but remain at London Stansted
OL,14,FAirport, with Nats, the UK's air
OL,15,Ftraffic services, blaming a technical
OL,16,Fglitch for widespread disruption.
OL,18,FThe pair, from Lincoln, are now due to
OL,19,Ftake off on Wednesday afternoon but
OL,20,Fwill miss a connecting flight, further
OL,21,Feating into their dream trip.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
