OL,3,GNEWSAHoneymoon couple spend night on
OL,4,Aairport floor
OL,5,
OL,6,FSam, who said they spent the night
OL,7,F"trying to sleep" on mats, added: "It's
OL,8,Fbeen horrendous. We are going all the
OL,9,Fway to the Maldives for about four
OL,10,Fdays, but hey ho, it's better than
OL,11,FSkegness."
